[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14463.03, "timestamp": "04:01:03", "text": "因为另一台电脑坏了，所以现在用这台电脑串流。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14466.07, "timestamp": "04:01:06", "text": "哦，不。我必须喜欢我现在的状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14468.79, "timestamp": "04:01:08", "text": "因为要限制使用，所以用得不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14471.67, "timestamp": "04:01:11", "text": "我在直播时使用的应用程序。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14475.67, "timestamp": "04:01:15", "text": "嗯，OBS，我不得不对它进行多次改造。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14478.79, "timestamp": "04:01:18", "text": "次数。说到 OBS，我以前用过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14481.269, "timestamp": "04:01:21", "text": "做得太过火了，比如添加了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14484.15, "timestamp": "04:01:24", "text": "插件，可以制作很多特效之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14487.189, "timestamp": "04:01:27", "text": "就像寿司龙那样。然后我意识到，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14492.15, "timestamp": "04:01:32", "text": "是的，CPU过载的情况经常发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14495.269, "timestamp": "04:01:35", "text": "我不可能拥有一切。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14497.349, "timestamp": "04:01:37", "text": "拥有非常棒的频道点，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14500.389, "timestamp": "04:01:40", "text": "人们可以声称喜欢的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14502.229, "timestamp": "04:01:42", "text": "兑换频道积分以关闭我的频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14505.51, "timestamp": "04:01:45", "text": "电脑之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14508.71, "timestamp": "04:01:48", "text": "你到底要怎么才能让它正常工作？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14511.269, "timestamp": "04:01:51", "text": "我的天哪，我用过的东西太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14515.11, "timestamp": "04:01:55", "text": "我尝试过，但不得不放弃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14518.07, "timestamp": "04:01:58", "text": "所有那些东西。是啊，你知道吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14519.59, "timestamp": "04:01:59", "text": "我可以，我会，我本来会是这样的，"}]